[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 101.",
    "start": 1.55,
    "end": 4.402,
    "zh": "第101课。",
    "zh_hant": "第101課。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "A card from Jimmy.",
    "start": 4.452,
    "end": 6.513,
    "zh": "吉米寄来的一张明信片。",
    "zh_hant": "吉米寄來的一張明信片。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 8.314,
    "end": 11.975,
    "zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Does grandmother seem pleased to get a card from Jimmy?",
    "start": 14.197,
    "end": 18.278,
    "zh": "祖母收到吉米的明信片似乎很高兴吗？",
    "zh_hant": "祖母收到吉米的明信片似乎很高興嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Why/Why not?",
    "start": 19.379,
    "end": 21.36,
    "zh": "为什么/为什么不？",
    "zh_hant": "為什麼/為什麼不？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Read Jimmy's card to me please, Penny.",
    "start": 23.721,
    "end": 26.983,
    "zh": "请给我读一下吉米的明信片，彭妮。",
    "zh_hant": "請給我讀一下吉米的明信片，彭妮。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "'I have just",
    "start": 26.633,
    "end": 30.044,
    "zh": "‘我刚",
    "zh_hant": "‘我剛"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "arrived in Scotland",
    "start": 29.694,
    "end": 31.585,
    "zh": "到达苏格兰",
    "zh_hant": "到達蘇格蘭"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "and I'm staying at a Youth Hostel.'",
    "start": 31.465,
    "end": 34.126,
    "zh": "并住在一家青年旅舍。’",
    "zh_hant": "並住在一家青年旅舍。’"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "Eh?",
    "start": 33.776,
    "end": 35.627,
    "zh": "嗯？",
    "zh_hant": "嗯？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "He says he's just arrived in Scotland.",
    "start": 36.568,
    "end": 40.469,
    "zh": "他说他刚到苏格兰。",
    "zh_hant": "他說他剛到蘇格蘭。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "He says he's staying at a Youth Hostel.",
    "start": 40.79,
    "end": 44.312,
    "zh": "他说他住在一家青年旅舍。",
    "zh_hant": "他說他住在一家青年旅舍。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "You know he's a member of the Y.H.A.",
    "start": 44.752,
    "end": 49.014,
    "zh": "你知道他是青年旅舍协会的成员。",
    "zh_hant": "你知道他是青年旅舍協會的成員。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "The what?",
    "start": 50.295,
    "end": 51.355,
    "zh": "什么协会？",
    "zh_hant": "什麼協會？"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "The Y.H.A., Mum.",
    "start": 52.396,
    "end": 54.917,
    "zh": "青年旅舍协会，妈妈。",
    "zh_hant": "青年旅舍協會，媽媽。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "The Youth Hostels Association.",
    "start": 55.257,
    "end": 58.199,
    "zh": "青年旅舍协会。",
    "zh_hant": "青年旅舍協會。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "What else does he say?",
    "start": 59.199,
    "end": 61.26,
    "zh": "他还说了什么？",
    "zh_hant": "他還說了什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "'I'll write a letter soon.",
    "start": 61.5,
    "end": 65.022,
    "zh": "‘我很快会写信。",
    "zh_hant": "‘我很快會寫信。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "I hope you are all well.'",
    "start": 65.582,
    "end": 69.004,
    "zh": "希望你们都好。’",
    "zh_hant": "希望你們都好。’"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "What?",
    "start": 68.654,
    "end": 69.484,
    "zh": "什么？",
    "zh_hant": "什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Speak up, Penny.",
    "start": 69.925,
    "end": 71.405,
    "zh": "大声点，彭妮。",
    "zh_hant": "大聲點，彭妮。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "I'm afraid I can't hear you.",
    "start": 72.306,
    "end": 75.027,
    "zh": "恐怕我听不见你说什么。",
    "zh_hant": "恐怕我聽不見你說什麼。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "He says he'll write a letter soon.",
    "start": 75.908,
    "end": 79.369,
    "zh": "他说他很快会写信。",
    "zh_hant": "他說他很快會寫信。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "He hopes we are all well.",
    "start": 79.669,
    "end": 82.272,
    "zh": "他希望我们都好。",
    "zh_hant": "他希望我們都好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "'Love, Jimmy.'",
    "start": 82.353,
    "end": 86.038,
    "zh": "‘爱你们的，吉米。’",
    "zh_hant": "‘愛你們的，吉米。’"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "Is that all?",
    "start": 85.688,
    "end": 86.799,
    "zh": "就这些吗？",
    "zh_hant": "就這些嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "He doesn't say very much, does he?",
    "start": 87.28,
    "end": 91.725,
    "zh": "他没写多少，对吧？",
    "zh_hant": "他沒寫多少，對吧？"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "can't write very much on a card, Mum.",
    "start": 91.375,
    "end": 94.95,
    "zh": "在明信片上写不了太多，妈妈。",
    "zh_hant": "在明信片上寫不了太多，媽媽。"
  }
]
